Third-party software
====================

SnoutData Studio is built on the following open source software. Each component is used under its
own licence, a copy of which is in that component's package (node_modules/<name>/) after `npm ci`
and in the packaged app's THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES file, which the build writes and which the app shows
under About, Third-party licences. Each also has dependencies of its own, under the licences
recorded in their packages; THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES lists those too, with their licence texts. This
list covers the direct dependencies.

